'''Ifuru Airport''' {{airport codes|IFU|VREI}} is a [[domestic airport]] located in the Ungoofaaru area in [[Maldives]]. It is an operational public airport.<ref>{{Cite web|title=VREI - Ifuru Island/Ifuru Airport Airport {{!}} SkyVector|url=https://skyvector.com/airport/VREI/Ifuru-Island-Ifuru-Airport-Airport|access-date=2021-06-29|website=skyvector.com}}</ref>

== Specifications ==
Ifuru Airport is at an [[elevation]] of 6&nbsp;ft (2m) from the [[Sea level|mean sea level]]. It has one runway with length 1200m and direction 18/36. The runway has an [[Asphalt concrete|asphalt]] surface.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Ifuru Airport Profile {{!}} CAPA|url=https://centreforaviation.com/data/profiles/airports/ifuru-airport-ifu|access-date=2021-06-29|website=centreforaviation.com}}</ref>

The airport caters small [[Island hopping|island-hopping]] flights.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Flying With Us|url=https://maldivian.aero/flying-with-us/|access-date=2021-06-29|website=Flying With Us|language=en}}</ref>

